 "description": "Look up the original factory window sticker (Monroney label) for a 17-character VIN, with an NHTSA specification decode. Returns links, never the PDF itself: `page` is the result page to give a person, and `pdf` is the label when one exists. For Toyota, Lexus, Nissan and Infiniti it returns only labels we already hold. Free, no key.",
